      "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix} x &amp; 9 \\\\ y &amp; z \\end{pmatrix} - 3 \\begin{pmatrix} z &amp; y \\\\ z &amp; y \\end{pmatrix} = k\\mathbf{I}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x, y, z\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> are constants.</p><p>Determine the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span>, the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\"></span> and the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p>",
