    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2023-june/q2",
      "question": "<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(z) = z^3 + az^2 + bz + 175\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span> are real constants</p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-3 + 4i\"></span> is a root of the equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(z) = 0\"></span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) determine the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> and the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Show all the roots of the equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(z) = 0\"></span> on a single Argand diagram.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(c) Write down the roots of the equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(z + 2) = 0\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></p>",
